{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_023_1000_p", "source_sha256": "73fcccd9f4ad0ed0daa3ed40ee7ad87a7aafa5bb18087836dcaea874d7ce2876", "ja": "なるほど。どうもいい匂いがすると思ったら……\n莉緒のエステ効果だったのか。", "zh": "原来如此。难怪我觉得有股香味……\n原来是莉绪去了美容沙龙的效果啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_023_1001_046rio", "source_sha256": "52243c6744599ab62f94ffcfb1f7b57fa10b8743176e0287a2f392abd6f9ce88", "ja": "あら、{$P$}くんったら盗み聞き？\nもう、エッチなんだから♪", "zh": "哎呀，{$P$}竟然偷听我们讲话？\n真是的，你这个色狼♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_023_1002_p", "source_sha256": "8088c39e306048926c2d381b558d9f3bf929496531303fb2af97408e18f1adae", "ja": "どうしてそうなるんだ……。\nみんなの声が、廊下まで聞こえてただけだからな？", "zh": "为什么这样就是色狼……\n纯粹是你们的声音大到连走廊都听得见好吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_023_1003_052kao", "source_sha256": "a967784b529c2794e36da6c093c12358e46a8502a1c363745f0aedfc1926ec5a", "ja": "ふふっ、ごめんなさい、{$P$}さん。\nついおしゃべりに夢中になってしまって。", "zh": "呵呵，抱歉啦，{$P$}先生。\n我们不小心聊得太投入了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_023_1004_039kon", "source_sha256": "4d28d40fe65a29bae7cd8a8d8f669d0759c997ce31711543f1652deab0a6ba91", "ja": "でも一応、今度の莉緒ちゃんのセンター公演のことを\n話してたのよね♪", "zh": "不过，我们还是有在讨论\n这次莉绪的Center公演喔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_023_1005_046rio", "source_sha256": "a3f85d9ff7355d29a65cfde67e609bc748aff715e9fd7176bdd2c7d0a4dbf062", "ja": "そうそう！　安心して、{$P$}くん。\n私、ちゃんと期待に応えてみせるから。", "zh": "没错没错！放心吧，{$P$}。\n我一定会好好回应你的期待。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_023_1006_046rio", "source_sha256": "d6e56a9b7a16284669377f20370095b4d321908c3d5f4f9b646dab1583994613", "ja": "磨き抜いた私のセクシーで、劇場中の男の子を\nみ～んな、トリコにしてみせるわ！", "zh": "我会用精心琢磨出的性感魅力，\n虏获剧场中所～有男孩子的心！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_023_1007_p", "source_sha256": "ecd2500b69de96542746d53c840ce73be5c59f7e4cece02b10e40e5e3fe3d31c", "ja": "みんなをトリコに、か……。\nうーん、それはいいんだけどなぁ。", "zh": "虏获所有人的心吗……\n唔～嗯，虽然这样也不错……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_023_1008_046rio", "source_sha256": "c60f6b3db1944232876c782c0c8db2d49241790d0b49145adf1039e1782ebcec", "ja": "あら、何かダメなことでもあるの？\n……あっ、わかった！　ヤキモチね、そうでしょ！", "zh": "哎呀，有什么不妥的吗？\n……啊，我知道了！你会吃醋，对吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_023_1009_046rio", "source_sha256": "07b5508606113360b79540205ff72d850e5b5b95169fcafee90326c81b58afe0", "ja": "仕方ないわねぇ。でも私、みんなのアイドルだし……\nそこはガマンしなきゃダメだぞ☆　なーんて！", "zh": "真拿你没办法。但我毕竟是大家的偶像呢……\n你要忍耐才行喔☆开玩笑的～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_023_1010_p", "source_sha256": "0b9d54c5c59fb69211dd48f1fde93fad2e88185dab2871ff0b8125f14ea32f49", "ja": "（今回、莉緒をセンターに指名した理由は、実は\nそこじゃない。莉緒の成長を期待したんだが……）", "zh": "（性感魅力并不是我这次指名莉绪担任Center的理由。\n我是因为期待莉绪能有所成长……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_023_1011", "source_sha256": "e270ec23d5b6ff96972f8f7ce419fa9a68cfadaff85b8bd73e39c0e874c4c578", "ja": "よし！", "zh": "好！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_023_2000_052kao", "source_sha256": "3ebdfbbbd528d321de0f4f7558d78c61589323da86867ca7ccaf1264bb05c265", "ja": "{$P$}さん、どうしたんですか？\nなんだか、難しい顔をなさっていますけど……？", "zh": "{$P$}先生，怎么了吗？\n你好像面有难色……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_023_2001_039kon", "source_sha256": "dc989ac6f5d333cd86b0295544ba0cefb0be6a9f937ea497632690c3c0e20da7", "ja": "まさか、本当にヤキモチを焼いてるわけじゃ\nないわよね？", "zh": "你该不会是真的在吃醋吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_023_2002_046rio", "source_sha256": "043110b9b0ff2efe0ba97221b0d05e848877b2d15c474da40ad8c268c7bb0b6b", "ja": "えっ？　や、やだもう、そんなわけ……。\nない、わよね？", "zh": "咦？讨、讨厌啦，怎么可能……\n应该……不可能吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_023_2003_p", "source_sha256": "2e241ec8581b828a2e38040286714cd266a94e4fd50a9f98087ced0d0110d7f4", "ja": "まあ、ヤキモチってわけじゃないよ。\nでも頼みがあるんだ。今度の公演では、莉緒の……。", "zh": "呃，我不是在吃醋啦。\n但有件事想拜托你，就是下次公演时……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_023_2004_p", "source_sha256": "e280078b87cc2627646bbe4ef85e2176328fca1f738f13bbc4cd373b1fc1a1b3", "ja": "身体じゃなくて、\n歌でみんなをトリコにしてくれるか？", "zh": "可以请莉绪你用歌声，\n而不是用身体来虏获大家的心吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_023_2005_046rio", "source_sha256": "3f2c5af7fc6c51677f5001330ad0f21c2a055164770b352697a88da44d6592cf", "ja": "え？　身体じゃないって……え？\n私の……セクシーボディじゃなくて？", "zh": "什么？不用身体……咦？\n不是用……我的性感身躯？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_023_2006_p", "source_sha256": "67fbd200f81a95eae34674b8d138b7b593ce3818a6e118906dd45c9ba40032d2", "ja": "そう、莉緒の歌で。", "zh": "没错，要用莉绪的歌声。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_023_2007_046rio", "source_sha256": "e41b9a045c285fe6a50801e8d62db39ccedb07bc3deb99bbc479f6ad4de06f13", "ja": "で……、でも、{$P$}くん？\n私がセンターに立つからには、こう……。", "zh": "但……但是，我说{$P$}啊，\n既然我要站Center，那就应该……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_023_2008_p", "source_sha256": "845d2f2c0713a30f945999e9fc1beaf90d12c37477df7e2dfb497c9a0c054b56", "ja": "もう決めたことだよ。しっかり頼むぞ！", "zh": "就这么决定了。拜托你啰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_023_2009_046rio", "source_sha256": "503812eab854c6702c3c1d1513d13ca048dc63d121cb67d09004ebb306bcd988", "ja": "頼むぞって、そんな……！", "zh": "什么叫拜托我，怎么这样……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_023_2010_p", "source_sha256": "6934f565d377d923f1dd1d6313bf2b4c8697699e60e2a85eaa10dffbefc1fdba", "ja": "このみさん、歌織さん。\n莉緒のサポート、しっかりお願いしますね。", "zh": "木实、歌织小姐。\n就麻烦你们好好协助莉绪了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
