{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_023_2013_039kon", "source_sha256": "ef09e662f6ee98df49f7351f6275a1cb0bccf36931a342ecd7d4163dd7d47db6", "ja": "ま、待って{$P$}。もちろん\nサポートはするけど、その……どういうつもりなの？", "zh": "等、等一下啦{$P$}。\n我们当然会协助她，不过……你的用意是什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_023_2014_052kao", "source_sha256": "1414b0cc5f2c9221512219a238ffad0d35de4f5cd73e70572a98b34f78fe8ec1", "ja": "そうです、{$P$}さん。\n莉緒ちゃん、せっかく張り切っていたのに……。", "zh": "就是啊，{$P$}先生。\n难得莉绪她那么有干劲……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
