{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_023_2016_046rio", "source_sha256": "a2a85b31d4ff7efd7c0bf0126e12480fa9d4579a1df0ef1f94b1d4ec6dd97051", "ja": "ま、待って{$P$}くん！\nそんな、セクシー禁止だなんて……ちょっとぉ！", "zh": "别、别走啊，{$P$}！\n怎么这样，居然禁止卖弄性感……等等啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_023_2017_se", "source_sha256": "08834fca48e72599d2e913c453081dc6bb74fc7dc341e72ad1e8d3f9d5c15c9a", "ja": "……ばたんっ", "zh": "……砰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
